{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ms-event-processor-collection",
    "name": "MS-Event-Processor API",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para MS-Event-Processor - Microservicio Event-Driven para procesamiento de órdenes",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🚀 Kafka - Enviar Mensajes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Enviar Mensaje de Prueba a Kafka",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/kafka/send-test",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "kafka", "send-test"]
            },
            "description": "Envía un mensaje de prueba con datos aleatorios al tópico orders-created de Kafka.\n\n**Equivalente a:** `./test-producer.sh`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar Mensaje Custom a Kafka",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"customerId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"eventType\": \"CREATED\",\n  \"totalAmount\": 250.00,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n      \"productName\": \"Premium Widget\",\n      \"quantity\": 3,\n      \"unitPrice\": 83.33\n    }\n  ],\n  \"shippingAddress\": {\n    \"street\": \"123 Main St\",\n    \"city\": \"New York\",\n    \"state\": \"NY\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"10001\",\n    \"country\": \"USA\"\n  },\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"source\": \"postman-test\",\n    \"correlationId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/kafka/send",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "kafka", "send"]
            },
            "description": "Envía un mensaje custom a Kafka.\n\nEl tópico se determina automáticamente según eventType:\n- CREATED → orders-created\n- UPDATED → orders-updates\n- CANCELLED → orders-cancelled"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar Evento UPDATE a Kafka",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n  \"customerId\": \"customer-123\",\n  \"eventType\": \"UPDATED\",\n  \"totalAmount\": 500.00,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"product-456\",\n      \"productName\": \"Updated Product\",\n      \"quantity\": 5,\n      \"unitPrice\": 100.00\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"source\": \"postman-test\",\n    \"correlationId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/kafka/send",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "kafka", "send"]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza una orden existente.\n\n**Requisito:** La orden debe existir previamente.\n**Reemplazar:** `{{order_id}}` con el ID de una orden existente."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar Evento CANCEL a Kafka",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n  \"customerId\": \"customer-123\",\n  \"eventType\": \"CANCELLED\",\n  \"totalAmount\": 250.00,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"source\": \"postman-test\",\n    \"correlationId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/kafka/send",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "kafka", "send"]
            },
            "description": "Cancela una orden existente.\n\n**Requisito:** La orden debe existir previamente.\n**Reemplazar:** `{{order_id}}` con el ID de una orden existente."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🗄️ Base de Datos - Verificar Órdenes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ver Todas las Órdenes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/database/check",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "database", "check"]
            },
            "description": "Lista todas las órdenes en la base de datos.\n\n**Equivalente a:** `./check-orders.sh`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver Orden Específica + Auditoría",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/database/check/{{order_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "database", "check", "{{order_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene una orden específica con su historial de auditoría completo.\n\n**Equivalente a:** `./check-orders.sh {order_id}`\n\n**Variables:** Reemplazar `{{order_id}}` con el ID de la orden."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "⚡ Procesamiento Directo (Sin Kafka)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Procesar Orden Directamente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"customerId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"eventType\": \"CREATED\",\n  \"totalAmount\": 300.00,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n      \"productName\": \"Direct Process Product\",\n      \"quantity\": 2,\n      \"unitPrice\": 150.00\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"source\": \"direct-api-test\",\n    \"correlationId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/process",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "process"]
            },
            "description": "Procesa una orden de manera síncrona sin usar Kafka.\n\nRetorna la orden procesada inmediatamente."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear Orden de Prueba Rápida",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/create-test",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "create-test"]
            },
            "description": "Crea una orden con datos de prueba generados automáticamente.\n\nIdeal para pruebas rápidas."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📋 Operaciones CRUD",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener Orden por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "{{order_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene una orden por su ID único."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Órdenes (Con Filtros)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders?status=PENDING",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "PENDING",
                  "description": "Filtrar por estado (PENDING, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED, etc.)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "customerId",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Filtrar por ID de cliente"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista órdenes con filtros opcionales por estado o cliente."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelar Orden",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "orders", "{{order_id}}", "cancel"]
            },
            "description": "Cancela una orden existente (cambia estado a CANCELLED)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
